    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nSIGPAC Nevarra maintains land use map for the vegetation in the region of Spain, We have collected the Open Licensed dataset for our inclusion in Fieldscapes project.\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [Euro Crops](https://zenodo.org/records/6868143/files/ES_NA_2020.zip?download=1)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [SIGPAC Navarra](https://sigpac.navarra.es/)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** CC-BY-4.0\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Dataset Validity:** 2020\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |\r\n| area                      | float     |\r\n| perimeter                 | float     |\r\n| crop_id                   | string    |\r\n| crop_name                 | string    |\r\n"
  },
